## 🧪 Tech Stack Considerations

| Language | Pros | Cons |
|----------|------|------|
| **Python** | Fast to build, readable, flexible | Large string escaping may slow parsing slightly |
| **C++**    | Absolute flex, more control | Verbose, string handling pain, longer compile times |

